        "title": "A capo, enfasi e importanza",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 144697,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A volte vogliamo formattare il testo dell'HUD di un gioco con interruzioni di riga.</p><p>Per esempio, questo pannello dello stato avrebbe un aspetto molto migliore se <code>Health: 100</code> comparisse su una riga, <code>Score: 2500</code> su quella successiva e così via.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;h1&gt;Player HUD&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt; Health: 100 Score: 2500 Level: 1 Lives: 3 &lt;/p&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 144698,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo separare le righe con l'aiuto del <strong>tag di interruzione di riga</strong>: <code>br</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"70\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Health: 100\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Score: 2500\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Level: 1 \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Lives: 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 144699,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>&lt;br&gt;</code> è un <strong>tag vuoto</strong>. I tag vuoti non hanno un tag di chiusura né contenuto. Sono anche chiamati tag autochiudenti.</p><p>Metti insieme il tag di interruzione di riga.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"71\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Health: 100\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Score: 2500\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Level: 1\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Lives: 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 144700,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esiste un elemento per dare enfasi al testo. Lo rende <em>corsivo</em>. Si chiama elemento <code>em</code>. Aggiungi <code>&lt;em&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Quest Log\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Current objective: \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Find the key\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Next area: Forest\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Enemies nearby: 3\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Treasure found: 1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 144701,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per definire i testi come importanti, usiamo i tag <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>. Rendono il testo <strong>in grassetto</strong>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"100\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Combat Alerts\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Incoming hit: \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"fireball\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Status: \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"LOW HEALTH\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 144702,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa serve il tag <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">Dà enfasi al testo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">Aggiunge un'interruzione di riga</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aggiunge un'interruzione di riga.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 144703,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale di questi tag è un tag vuoto o autochiudente?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;br&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;/em&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
