            "id": 144704,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali di questi tag danno enfasi al testo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;em&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt;em&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
